-- Content cleanup — ALREADY APPLIED to project omqyueddktqeyrrqvnyq on
-- 2026-08-16. Kept as the record of what changed. (EVALUATION.md roadmap
-- items 3: de-CAPS at source, related_slugs, dead intro table.)
--
-- 1. De-CAPS: 270 grammar_rules rows contained mid-sentence ALL-CAPS shouting
--    ("sound TRULY German", "Infinitiv am ENDE!"). 892 string edits were
--    applied, generated by scripts/decaps-grammar-rules.mjs, which ports the
--    display-time normalizer (astro-site/src/components/RichText.astro) and
--    adds correct German orthography: corpus-frequency + determiner heuristics
--    decide Titlecase for nouns ("am ENDE" → "am Ende", "das GEFÜHL" → "das
--    Gefühl") vs lowercase for everything else ("ÄNDERN sich" → "ändern
--    sich"); roman numerals, line-initial labels, ending markers ("-ER") and
--    mixed-case tokens are preserved; SS→ß overrides (BLOSS → bloß).
--    The full UPDATE set is reproducible: run the script against a content
--    dump and apply the generated decaps-updates.sql. RichText.astro stays in
--    place as a no-op safety net for any future shouting.
--
-- 2. related_slugs: populated for all 64 grammar_topics from the hand-curated
--    map in astro-site/src/lib/relatedTopics.js (was empty everywhere; the
--    static site prefers the DB column when present). Statements below.
--
-- 3. grammar_introductions is DEAD: the SPA reads lesson intros from
--    grammar_rules rule_type='introduction' (src/services/grammarService.js
--    — "NO grammar_introductions - using grammar_rules instead"), all 64
--    topics have one, and the table holds a single orphan row. Drop it when
--    convenient (NOT executed automatically — owner's call):
